:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F6=Print
:PD.Prints the display.
:PT.F8=Display jobs
:PD.Display jobs.
:PT.F9=Command line
:PD.Shows a command line to run a command from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F14=Display port numbers
:PD.Display port numbers.
:PT.F24=More keys
:PD.Shows the other function keys of the display.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DRHOST'.Remote host name
:P.The remote host name shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DRADR'.Remote internet address
:P.An internet address in dotted decimal form (IPv4) or in colon form
(IPv6).
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DRPORT'.Remote port
:P.The remote port shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DLHOST'.Local host name
:P.The local host name shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DLADR'.Local internet address
:P.The local internet address shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DLPORT'.Local port
:P.The local port shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DUSER'.Associated user profile
:P.The associated user profile shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSTATE'.State
:P.The state shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DOPEN'.Connection open type
:P.The connection open type shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DIDLE'.Idle time
:P.The idle time shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DLAST'.Last activity date/time
:P.The last activity date/time shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DRTT'.Round-trip time
:P.The round-trip time shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DRTTV'.Round-trip variance
:P.The round-trip variance shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DBOUT'.Bytes out
:P.The bytes out shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DOBUF'.Outgoing bytes buffered
:P.The outgoing bytes buffered shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DUSNDNXT'.User send next
:P.The user send next shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSNDNXT'.Send next
:P.The send next shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSNDUNA'.Send unacknowledged
:P.The send unacknowledged shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DOPUSH'.Outgoing push number
:P.The outgoing push number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DOURG'.Outgoing urgency number
:P.The outgoing urgency number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DOWIN'.Outgoing window number
:P.The outgoing window number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DBIN'.Bytes in
:P.The bytes in shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DIBUF'.Incoming bytes buffered
:P.The incoming bytes buffered shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DRCVNXT'.Receive next
:P.The receive next shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DURCVNXT'.User receive next
:P.The user receive next shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DIPUSH'.Incoming push number
:P.The incoming push number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DIURG'.Incoming urgency number
:P.The incoming urgency number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DIWIN'.Incoming window number
:P.The incoming window number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DRETR'.Total retransmissions
:P.The total retransmissions shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DCRETR'.Current retransmissions
:P.The current retransmissions shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSWMAX'.Maximum size
:P.The maximum size shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSWCUR'.Current size
:P.The current size shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSWUPD'.Last update
:P.The last update shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSWACK'.Last update acknowledged
:P.The last update acknowledged shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DCWND'.Congestion window
:P.The congestion window shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
